                "EN" : "Most of the flats disposes of a room with two beds (devided or double), living room with cooking area, bathroom with shower, utility room and a spacious terrace. At guests' disposal there are: fridge, tableware, satellite TV, free Wi-Fi, bed and table linen on demand, laudry room (washing machine and dryer) and several car parks.",
