            },
            "description" : {
                "EN" : "Tourists has the chance to choose plenty of walking tours, in the middle of conifer forests, green meadows, path and walks, along mountain tracks and natural beauties. So far, Hotel Miramonti is  the main point for trips or mountain bike trekking around Monte Bondone, Monte Stivo, and Valle dei Laghi. The hotel has lift, car parking and garden, and offers 33 spacious, comfortably, high standard furnished rooms, all with personal balcony with sitting area that looks out over the pond and the beautiful park, bath, shower, hair dryer, direct telephone line for private calls and Internet, satellite colour television, sun terrace, lounge room and bar. Innovative cooking with local typical dishes.",
                "IT" : "Si trova in un punto strategico per quanto riguarda salutari camminate panoramiche e pedalate in mountain bike ed è quindi un ottima base di partenza per escursioni e passeggiate alle pendici del Monte Bondone. Le nostre 33 stanze, accuratamente arredate, sono dotate di balcone, servizi con box doccia, asciugacapelli, telefono e TV color. Dispone inoltre di bar, sala ristorante, pizzeria, sala soggiorno, ascensore, terrazza con solarium, giardino e parcheggio. Cucina innovativa con specialità trentine."
