                "IT" : "Lago di Santa Colomba"
            },
            "description" : {
                "EN" : "An essential part of the Ecomuseo Argentario, this lake is in a wooded basin at an altitude of 926 m in the municipality of Civezzano. It is of geological interest because it is located on a fault between rock of volcanic origin (quartz porphyry) and rock of a sedimentary nature (the calcareous rock of Mount Calisio). The area is favourite for the amenities offered by the green waters which reflect the sky and the pine trees and for the extensive beauty of the surrounding area. ",
                "IT" : "Il lago di Santa Colomba si trova in Valle di Cembra, e fa parte dell’Ecomuseo dell’Argentario. Adatto a passeggiate nel verde e a soste di relax. "
