            },
            "description" : {
                "EN" : "The Maso Sveseri, a family concern, opened in 1984 as an agritur, and continues to offer home-made specialities and traditional favourites for those who appreciate good food. We are also able to offer a refined ice-cream parlour, due to our experience of over ten years in the field. In  1997 we added our pizzeria which offers delicious pizzas cooked to perfection in our computerized wood burning oven. Finally we have five attic rooms offering 15 beds in all, which has the advantage on our restaurant and facilities, situated between two splendid Trentino valleys - the Cembra Valley and the High Plain of Pine, half an hour car ride from the very heart of the Dolomites.",
                "IT" : "Il Ristorante Maso Sveseri, a conduzione familiare, ha iniziato la sua attività nel 1984 come Agritur, e tutt'ora propone specialità casalinghe, frutto di una lunga esperienza al servizio di chi ricerca la buona cucina. Il ristorante Maso Sveseri è anche un'affermata gelateria e un'ottima pizzeria. Infine è dotato di cinque confortevoli camere in mansarda."
