            "entityUri" : null,
            "name" : {
                "EN" : "",
                "IT" : "Pian del Gacc"
            },
            "description" : {
                "EN" : "Enthusiasts of sport and life in the open air will find what they want at Pian del Gacc and at Fornace. The area immersed in green is the perfect place for walks or mountain bike outings, surrounded by nature, history and local legends. Pian del Gacc is equipped with two tennis courts, a playing field, a bowls court and an efficient refreshment point with bar service- The Monte Piano path is an excursion for the whole family which takes the visitor through woods and meadows on the high pastures above the village, passing by many signs of the intense and famous mining activity (cavities and vertical and horizontal mines) which involved the area in the middle ages. On a stretch of the path through the woods in the Monte Piano area, there is a series of sculpted gnomes, the work of a local artist.",
                "IT" : "Pian del Gacc è un’area ricreativa immersa nel verde attrezzata con due campi da tennis, parco giochi e campi di bocce per poter praticare numerosi sport all’aria aperta. Nella zona sono anche presenti delle antiche miniere d’argento, dette canope"
