                "EN" : "",
                "IT" : "Chiesa di San Mauro"
            },
            "description" : {
                "EN" : "Already mentioned in a document of 1242, it was certainly the first parish church of Piné. Today, it has a gothic-renaissance style and, in contrast with the simple façade, it has an elegant prothyrum with three arches decorated with four red stone columns with Corinthian capitols. The small church has a fine baroque wooden altar, a famous gothic triptych in sculpted and gilded woodnd several interesting frescoes. ",
                "IT" : "Citata già in un documento del 1242, fu sicuramente la prima Pieve pinetana. Oggi si presenta in stile gotico-rinascimentale e, in contrasto con la semplice facciata, spicca l`elegante protiro a tre campate, ornato da quattro colonne di pietra rossa con capitello corinzio"
