            },
            "description" : {
                "EN" : "CASA PORFIDO' aims at documenting, valorising and popularising the various skills involved in the quarrying of porphyry. One of the striking characteristics of this museum is the harmony between tradition and ultra-modern multimedia tools. In an interactive setting, visitors can discover at first hand the ancient history of porphyry quarrying and learn more about the local socio-economic fabric. They can watch historical films/documentaries and marvel at the age-old skill of porphyry stone cutting as well as at the incredible amount of precision required when laying porphyry. ",
                "IT" : "Il nuovo museo del porfido di Albiano si propone di documentare l`evoluzione delle tecniche di estrazione e lavorazione attraverso Strumenti multimediali all’avanguardia, ponendosi come attrazione turistica di alto valore didattico."
