                "IT" : "Piramidi di Terra di Segonzano"
            },
            "description" : {
                "EN" : "A masterpiece of nature: towers, crests, pinnacles arranged like organ pipes, tall columns towered by a huge porphyry rock  these are the earth pyramids in the municipality of Segonzano. One of the most well known and studied geological phenomena in the world, also for its imposing beauty. The remains of a moraine deposit dating back to the last ice age, the pyramids are now a tourist attraction of great didactic value. The site is open to visitors all the year round, and can be reached by a specially equipped, clearly marked path.",
