                "IT" : "Santuario Madonna dell`Aiuto"
            },
            "description" : {
                "EN" : "At Segonzano there is a sanctuary dedicated to Maria Ausilitrice, better known as the Madonna dellAiuto (Our Lady Help of Christians). The building, as it appears today, is the result of recent extensions carried out in 1961. Inside, there is the miraculous painting of the Madonna dellAiuto, which is a copy of the Mariahilf by Lukas Cranach conserved at Innsbruck It was commissioned and brought to Segonzano in 1682-83 by Baron Francesco Ferdinando of Prato. The painting was immediately placed in a chapel near Segonzano, which soon became the destination of pilgrimages by many devoted people. In 1820 the building was turned into a sanctuary. ",
                "IT" : "All’ombra di un plurisecolare tiglio, si trova il Santuario dedicato a Maria Ausiliatrice, meglio conosciuta come Madonna dell’Aiuto\". L’edificio, come si presenta oggi, è il risultato del recente ampliamento del 1961. All’interno conserva il \"miracoloso\" quadro della Madonna dell’Aiuto.\""
            },
