                "EN" : "",
                "IT" : "HOTEL BELVEDERE WELLNESS & FAMILY"
            },
            "description" : {
                "EN" : "Belvedere Hotel attends you with its newly renovated structure and traditional cordiality, competence and comfort for your mountains holiday. Easly reaches also by bus, our Hotel is immersed in a forest of firs, larches and pine trees in a peaceful area, ideal starting point for beautiful walks and excursions. During your stay, enjoy our excellent cuisine enriched by Salad/Vegetable bars and breakfast buffet with choice of daily menus. Our elegant lift will accompany you to comfortable rooms with washroom, telephone and TV, safe, hair dryer. You will be able to play ping pong, to use mountain bike, to ride in the operating within the national health service handling, or to rest in the garden or to the shadow of the gazebo For children there is a park where play, scaldabiberon, fasciatoio, lettini, seggioloni. Every day free bus can to lagos or in center.nWhatever the occasion, let our cordial staff offer you a peaceful and leisurely holiday, no matter how long or short it is.",
                "IT" : "Nel cuore del Trentino, un paesaggio unico che alterna la dolcezza dell'Altopiano di Pinè con l'asprosità della Val di Cembra. Quì la natura si è davvero sbizzarrita disegnando laghi cristallini, boschi verdissimi, pareti di roccia striate e infiniti terrazzamenti di viti. All'HOTEL BELVEDERE WELLNESS & FAMILY ***s le famiglie troveranno una struttura moderna con ampi spazi a misura di bimbo. Stanze con ogni comfort, un cucunino attrezzato 24 ore su 24. Un centro benessere con piscine, mondo saune, beauty e palestra fitness."
