            },
            "description" : {
                "EN" : "Our Hotel is in traditional style, with spacious common space to relax yourself and appreciate a beautiful view of Fiemme Valley and Dolomiti: living room and bar with internet point, tavern, meeting room, game room, breakfast room, two dining rooms, garages and parking.  From our Hotel you can easily reach the centre of Cavalese, as well all the activities you can practise in our valley.\nWellness centre with mini-swimming pool with water games and whirlpool, Finnish sauna, Turkish bath, hay sitting, tropical showers, solarium. Our beautician proposes esthetical treatment, massages beauty special offers.     \nWe offer to our guest many choice of accommodations: single rooms, double rooms, triples, mini-suites and suites. Each with private shower, hair-dryer, radio, tv-sat, frigo bar, safe, telephone and balcony. \nSource of our pride is our light and fine cuisine which we offer to our residents in various menus to taste local or traditional Italian food. Interesting choice of local ",
