            "entityUri" : null,
            "name" : {
                "IT" : "SPORT HOTEL SASS MAOR"
            },
            "description" : {
                "EN" : "The Hotel, recently build, is in the center of Predazzo, 100 meter from the bus station. The hotel has different furniture, linked together with the material used: wood. In the picture above represents the living-room, near to the reception and the bar.\n\n\nNear the dinner room there are a little \"stube\" made in wood. In this place you can eat the speciality of the restaurant and drink our wine.\n\n\nRecently we have open the fitness room with watermassage, sauna, cyclette, tapis-roulant and step. Near this place there are the new club \"Springer Kommt\", all made in wood with live music.\n\n\nIn the Hotel there are 27 rooms, all with balcon, WC and television. Three of this are with water massage and three are suite.",
                "IT" : "Elegantemente arredato in stile Liberty, lo Sport Hotel Sass Maor offre ai suoi ospiti un ambiente confortevole e rilassante. I proprietari dell`albergo, da 25 anni nel settore, sono cordiali, disponibili e cercano il dialogo amichevole con gli ospiti al fine di rendere a ciascuno il miglior servizio. \n\nUn`accogliente hall introduce gli ospiti al bar, nelle sale ristorante e nella tipica stube tirolese.\n\nL`hotel dispone di ascensore, taverna a giardino. Per le vetture ampio garage riscaldato e parcheggio privato. Il pullmino privato dell`albergo garantisce splendide gite guidate organizzate direttamente dai proprietari.\n\nLe camere sono confortevolmente arredate in chiaro legno di abete, dispongono di servizi privati con doccia, telefono diretto, televisione a colori e cassaforte. Ciascuna di esse ed ogni piano camere e` stato realizzato secondo criteri massima funzionalita` e sicurezza.\n\nLa cucina e` molto curata e prevede un`ampia scelta di raffinate specialita internazionali e regionali."
            },
            "longDescription" : {},
            "serviceDescription" : {
                "EN" : "hay baths : 1\nadventure tours : 1\nsingle room/s : 5\nEnglish : 1\nown garden : 1\nmulti-bed room/s : 3\nwireless corner : 1\nright at the ski-bus/bus stop : 1\nwine cellar : 1\ndouble room/s : 19\nguest tournament : 1\nsteambath : 1\nwhirlpool : 1\ncovered parking for cars : 1\nmountain activities : 1\nbike rental : 1\nbus parking space : 1\nbar : 1\nrelaxation room : 1\norganized activities/guest services/house program : 1\ncar parking lot : 1\ntanning booth : 1\nGerman : 1\nlive music : 1\nwheelchair access : 1\nsunbathing lawn : 1\nbiosauna : 1\nski storeroom : 1\naerobics room : 1\ndisabled accessible : 1\ndance : 1\nTV room : 1\nrestaurant : 1\nhikes/guided hiking tours : 1\ncentral location : 1\nsauna : 1\nKneipp's facility : 1\naromatic steam sauna : 1\nsundeck : 1\nbus groups possible : 1\ninternet - e-mail available : 1\ncellar bar : 1\nlift/elevator : 1\n",
