            "contact" : {
                "name" : {
                    "IT" : "Trentino Trentino Residences"
                },
                "phone" : "+39/0461/930460",
                "fax" : "+39/0461/930781",
                "mail" : "info@trentinoresidences.it",
                "url" : "http://www.trentinoresidences.it"
            },
            "seatingCapacity" : {},
            "accessibility" : {},
            "timetable" : {},
            "pric" : {}
        },
        "objData" : {
            "objectUri" : "universiadi2013@0d5472e9-74c1-4b88-9b76-6330eb3abf4a",
            "entityUri" : null,
            "name" : {
                "IT" : "MAJESTIC"
            },
            "description" : {
                "EN" : "Welkome to Trentino Residences! Trentino Residences is a leader in self-catering accomodation in the Dolomites’ area!\n\nNot far from Predazzo centre, Aparthotel Majestic offers luxuriously furnished and well equipped apartments for 2, 3, 4 and 5 people with telephone, satellite TV, safe, hairdrier and lift. The garden behind the Aparthotel has a children´s playing area and a barbecue. Aparthotel Majestic is the perfect starting point for summer excursions to the Dolomites of Fiemme and Fassa as well as those of the S. Martino di Castrozza area. Paneveggio Natural Park is at a few kilometres´distance. The centre of Predazzo is 300 mt far. The facilities for our guests are: large entrance hall with Internet Point, restaurant-pizzeria, swimming pool and health club (Finnish and Turkish sauna, sunbed), gym, playroom (pools, table tennis, videogames), baby room, disco, laundry, parking place and garage, garden with children's playing area. Look our special offers too!",
                "IT" : "A pagamento invece: ristorante/pizzeria interno con servizio take away (per info sui prezzi delle convenzioni tel. 0462/500076), internet point, lavanderia e stireria a gettoni, garage (€ 5,00 al giorno, € 40,00 la settimana di capodanno), connessione internet Wi Fi dagli appartamenti (€ 15,00 a settimana), noleggio passeggino (€ 10,00 a settimana) e zaino porta bebè (€ 5,00 al giorno).\nDisponiamo di appartamenti da due a cinque posti letto arredati in stile tirolese e perfettamente corredati. Tutti dispongono di telefono, televisore, asciugacapelli, bollitore, cucina arredata e corredata, cassaforte, balcone o giardinetto. Non sono ammessi gli animali.\nI prezzi si intendono tutto incluso, cioè comprensivi di biancheria da letto e da bagno, pulizie finali, consumi ed entrata a tutti i servizi comuni sopra elencati. \n"
            },
