        "objData" : {
            "objectUri" : "universiadi2013@a1143072-cb68-4b76-8444-5e5552741696",
            "entityUri" : null,
            "name" : {
                "IT" : "MARIA"
            },
            "description" : {
                "EN" : "The management is employed passionately and professionally, so that their guests could spend their holidays at the sign of serenity, tradition and friendliness. Hotel Maria has got 23 comfortable rooms, all provided with private bathroom, colour-TV, telephone and hair-drier. \nThe well kept cooking offers a choice menu, where you can taste national and typical dishes prepared with care by our cooker Sergio. Breakfast, as well as all sorts of vegetables for lunch and dinner, are available by our rich buffet: just take as much as your wish. \nA garden is offered to our kind guests, where you can spend agreeable moments of relax. \nHotel Maria is situated in a good position: 500m to the centre of the village, and just 1 Km to the sloops of \"Ski Center Latemar\". You can reach this ski area by skibus, which is in front of the Hotel and it is free. So come to visit us, leave your car in our parking and go around our magnificent valley by skibus, it will be easier and nature will thank you!\nThe village of Predazzo is placed between Fiemme and Fassa Valley and it represents a good starting point for all your excursion by foot or by car thorough Dolomiti during the summer season.",
                "IT" : "Benvenuti nella nostra accogliente casa, che per qualche giorno potrà essere anche la vostra...\n\nL'ambiente ideale per evadere dalla quotidianità nel calore amichevole che Vi potremo offrire.\nL'hotel Maria, a Predazzo, è meta ideale per gli amanti della montagna. Con la sua conduzione familiare e la cucina caratteristica del luogo, offre una vacanza rilassante. \nIngrid e Sergio, il nostro cuoco, faranno del loro meglio per appagare ogni vostro bisogno: dall'organizzazione della vostra giornata, alla soddisfazione dei palati più diversi.\nSarà difficile dimenticarVi di questa vacanza e... perchè no anche di noi!"
            },
            "longDescription" : {},
            "serviceDescription" : {
