                "IT" : "ALBERGO VERONZA"
            },
            "description" : {
                "EN" : "HOLIDAY CENTRE VERONZA \nThe biggest and best equipped resort of Val di Fiemme, surrounded by an unspoiled nature, located in a quiet sunny position with a wonderful view over the Dolomites. Easy reachable with 20 minutes drive from the motorway-exit Ora-Egna and 2 Km away from Cavalese`s town center. The resort and the organization offer you all services and facilities for a perfect holiday: \nINCLUDED: entertainment and sport programs, welcome cocktail, private disco, baby-club and baby dance (3-10 years), indoor swimming pool with beautiful view over the surrounding mountains, gym with table-tennis, large common rooms, card-room, TV. room, safe at the reception, mountain bike deposit, car parking. \nOPTIONAL: Italian and international restaurant, pizzeria, a fully equipped beauty-club, automatic laundry, garage. Locally also: bancomat, 4 tennis, a volleyball and a basketball courts. \nACCOMMODATION:\nHotel Veronza *** in a sunny and panoramic position, offers double elegant mansard-room with bathroom with shower, SAT TV-set, direct dial telephone. For families and friends, the hotel also offer the \"suite\": accommodation in studios with balcony, with special offers if the guest are more than two. Free use of all amenities and facilities of Holiday Centre Veronza.",
                "IT" : "Il CENTRO VACANZE VERONZA offre una realtà ben organizzata, con tutti i servizi ed i comfort per una vacanza a misura di famiglia.\nMEZZA PENSIONE: colazione  a buffet, cena con bevande (Merlot e Chardonnay Trentino di nostra produzione, cola, aranciata, thè freddo, succo di mela, acqua naturale e gassata, il tutto alla spina) e TEA TIME pomeridiano INCLUSI.\nINCLUSI: BABY CLUB e Bottega della Fantasia con orario prolungato e possibilità di cena, accesso alla zona wellness, alla palestra e alla piscina.\n"
