            "entityUri" : null,
            "name" : {
                "IT" : "LA STUA"
            },
            "description" : {
                "EN" : "The Hotel la Stua lies in the very centre of Cavalese at the corner with the Piazza dei Francescani, right at the beginning of the village. Despite it´s centrality, the hotel is quiet and peaceful, a calm corner with a well equipped garden where you can enjoy the view on the tower of San Sebastiano and the Lagorai Group while being enlighted by candles made of pure wax. Enjoy delicate meat and venison until late... with superfine local Grappas. Home sweet home is often told in hotels, but not here, not the guests of the Vanzo family.\nThe new beauty farm and the relaxing baths vitalise the mind, the body and the soul. The health centre is open daily from 09.00 to 18.00. A Tyrolean Hay sauna is more than a bunch of dry grass. We admit that alpine plants like Erica and Gentian are perhaps not so famous as Sissi and Cleopatra are. Nevertheless, you will get to know the characteristics of the hay and appreciate them. Just try it! Like the Cleopatra bath, you will lay on a bed, but instead of milk, your entire body enveloped in hay. This treatment provides a beauty and a mental well being.",
                "IT" : "Con il suo ricercatissimo e originale arredamento in tipico stile di montagna, frutto di annose e pazienti ricerche, l'hotel La Stua, la cui gestione è particolarmente accurata e attenta, si integra perfettamente con le esigenze di coloro che dalla vacanza si aspettano il massimo comfort specialmente dopo le pratiche sportive. In posizione centralissima e soleggiata, dispone di camere tutte con servizi, tv color con telecomando, telefono, radio, sauna e parcheggio, dedica inoltre particolare attenzione al tempo con programmi propri  di incentivazione sia per l'estate sia per l'inverno."
            },
