            },
            "description" : {
                "EN" : "To Ziano, Val di Fiemme, in the centre of the village but far enough to be in full tranquillity, our bed & breakfast welcomes new spaces, landscaped and furnished with the simplicity of the familiar proposal. We put at your disposal a space on the ground floor, in contact with the garden. The structure offers rooms with double or single beds, a livingroom in which to have breakfast, read books on the culture and traditions of Trentino South Tyrol and Val di Fiemme, eat something, exchanging two chat with other guests or with the owners. Rooms have private bathrooms, so as to ensure the full autonomy and confidentiality. The FAMILY ROOM or FRIENDS ROOM (4 beds) is composed of two double bedrooms and a bathroom and is particularly suitable for families or friends who want to stay close. On sunny days in summer you can sit in the garden to enjoy a relaxing time. Skibus free.",
