                "EN" : "holiday apartment/s : 1\nright on the slope : 1\ntransfer : 1\nEnglish : 1\ncentral location : 1\nquiet location : 1\nbed/s : 6\ncash payment : 1\nown garden : 1\nedge of ski run : 1\nmeadowlands : 1\ncar parking lot : 1\ngreen area : 1\nright at the ski-bus/bus stop : 1\nluggage storage : 1\nGerman : 1\nright at the cross-country ski trail : 1\ncommon room : 1\nmulti-bed room/s : 2\n",
