        "objData" : {
            "objectUri" : "universiadi2013@a9dbfc22-f8fd-4221-99cb-3cf5f2942e8a",
            "entityUri" : null,
            "name" : {
                "IT" : "DES ALPES"
            },
            "description" : {
                "EN" : "Welcome to Trentino Residences! Trentino Residences is a leader in self-catering accomodation in the Dolomites’ area!\n\nLocated in a quiet and sunny position just Km 1,5 from Cavalese centre, Apathotel Des Alpes offers apartments for 2, 4 and 6 people, well-equipped and furnished in a tipical Tyrolean style. All have telephone, new satellite TV, safe, hairdrier, duvet and microwave. Animals are admitted upon request (not in studio x 4 south).\nFacilities for our clients: large entrance hall with Internet Point, restaurant-pizzeria also with take away service, swimming pool and health club (Finnish and Turkish sauna, sunbeds), gym, arcade (snooker, table tennis, video games), baby room, common laundry, parking, garage, ski clinc and rental. Entertainment programme with baby club from New Year's Eve since the first week of January.\nDistance from town centre: 1, 500 km Distance from ski areas: 1 km to Alpe Cermis and 10 km to Pampeago-Obereggen. Distance from cross-country circuits: 10 km to Lavaze', 5 km lago di Tesero. Free skibus stop: 10 mt. Look our special offers too!",
                "IT" : "Alle famiglie con bambini piccoli forniamo inoltre gratuitamente il “kit bambino”: seggiolone, vaschetta bagno, scalda biberon, lettino da campeggio con le sponde e fasciatoio.\n\n\nIn auto: dall’ uscita Egna/Ora dell’ autostrada A22 del Brennero, si percorre la Statale 48 delle Dolomiti; 24 km per Cavalese. Una volta arrivati a Cavalese seguite la strada principale fino ad una chiesa con il campanile simile ad una torre, subito prima svoltate a destra e seguite la strada per circa 1,5 Km. Ci trovate sulla sinistra."
            },
