            },
            "description" : {
                "EN" : "Predazzo is to 1000 ms. of altitude among the Dolomiteses, stings of ideal departure for innumerable excursions. \nFor the one that the mountain prefers it in winter, Predazzo is directly connected with the Ski Center Latemar, Obereggen, Lusia, passo Rolle and Alpe Cermis. \nOur Hotel recently restructured is found in calm and sunny position.\nAll the rooms have private services, Tv-Sat, balcony, safety cassette and telephone. \nHotel has besides a room cafe-stay, saletta Tv, tavern, elevator, ample parking place and garden. Appreciated by our clients it is the family atmosphere and a kitchen personally taken care of by the owners",
                "IT" : "Il nostro hotel, di recente ammodernato, si trova alla periferia di Predazzo in posizione tranquilla e soleggiata. Tutte le camere sono con doccia, WC, balcone, televisione e ascensore. L'albergo dispone inoltre di sala bar/soggiorno, saletta tv, sala lettura/tavernetta, ampio posteggio e giardino. I trattamenti offerti sono: pernottamento e prima colazione o mezza pensione con curata cucina casalinga."
            },
