            "name" : {
                "IT" : "MASO GANZAIE"
            },
            "description" : {
                "EN" : "Vacation in summer and winter between the LatemarGroup, the Lagorai Range, and the Pale di San Martino. Endless possibilities for hiking and toursu`start directly from the hotel on foot, with a mountain bike (rentals available), or on horseback with a horse from the neighboring stables. \nThe cultivated kitchen offers a variety of national and regional dishes and wines in the Trentino tradition.36 bright rooms with WC/shower or bath, telephone, most having a terrace or balcony and television.\nThe Hotel Ganzaie is part of a lovely landscape and intact nature and the edge of a centuries old spruce forest.Large spaces are also available for use: a recreation room with TV, dining room, bar, sauna, and a sunny garden with a playground for smaller guests. \nLa Valle di Fiemme belongs to the celebrated \"Superski Dolomiti.\" The major centers are Pampeago - Obereggen (more than 60 km of ski slopes in one location), Alpe Cermis, Passo Rolle, and Alpe Luisa. There are numerous slopes by Passo di Lavaze`, as well as a cross country track for cross country skiers and the slopes that hosted the 1991 World Championships (future host site for the 2003 World Championships).\nDaiano, peacefully located between the provinces of Trento and Bolzano, is an ideal location from which to make excursions to Trento, Bolzano, Merano...",
