                "EN" : "Located on the southern bank of Lake Caldonazzo, just 10 m away from the lake and its beach, Camping Riviera awaits its guests and offers them a pleasant holiday surrounded by nature. Placed in a peaceful spot, its position gives guests the chance to take advantage of the wide array of walks and excursions that can be enjoyed on the mountains that surround it. \nThe camp site is well organised and well structured. It has a laundry room complete with a coin-operated dryer and washing machine. In addition, its hot showers are free and have been completely refurbished, as has its dishwashing room. Furthermore, a restaurant, pizzeria, and rotisserie is located just a short distance away. The camp site’s lots are completely covered with grass and enjoy lots of shade, so that you can relax, far away from the bustle of city life and all of the noise that accompanies it. Featured in: ACSI, ADAC Camping Caravaning Führer, DCC. \n\n",
                "IT" : "Situato sulla sponda sud del Lago di Caldonazzo a 10m. dal lago e dalla spiaggia, il Camping Riviera vi aspetta per una piacevole vacanza immersi nel verde in una zona tranquilla, in una posizione che offre la possibilità di numerose passeggiate ed escursioni sui monti che gli fanno da cornice. \nIl campeggio ben strutturato ed organizzato ha un locale lavanderia con lavatrice ed asciugatoio a gettoni; le docce calde gratuite sono state completamente ristrutturate come anche il locale lavapiatti e nelle immediate vicinanze un ristorante, pizzeria e rosticceria. \nLe piazzole sono completamente erbose e ben ombreggiate per un periodo di riposo lontano dal caos cittadino e dai rumori che accompagnano la vita quotidiana delle grandi città. \n\nPossibilità di sconti con tessera ACSI\n\nSegnalato da: ACSI, ADAC Cam ping Caravaning Führer, DCC.\n"
            },
            "longDescription" : {},
            "serviceDescription" : {
                "EN" : "beach can be reached on foot : 1\nuse of washing machine/dryer : 0\nAuto aggiuntiva (euro/ notte) : 5\ncamping guide recommendation… : 1\nplayground : 1\nsingle washing cabins with hot water : 1\ngroceries/shop : 1\ncamp space lighting : 1\noutskirts of town : 1\nplayground : 1\nlong-term camping spaces : 1\nshowers with hot water : 1\ndrain for chemical toilets : 1\nshort-term stays welcome : 1\non the lake : 1\ncoin-operated washing machine/dryer : 1\ncredit cards accepted : 1\nrestaurant : 1\nNumero piazzole : 110\npets welcome : 1\nGettone lavatrice (euro/ per uso) : 0\nNumero bagni : 18\ncash payment : 1\nelectrical connection for campers : 1\ntable tennis : 1\nEnglish : 1\nfree use of internet : 1\nGerman : 1\ndisposal facility for mobile homes : 1\nbar : 1\ndish basin : 1\nlake - distance (m) : 20\ngarden barbecue : 1\n",
