            },
            "description" : {
                "EN" : "Located in Strigno and immersed in its own orchard, B&B Tomaselli is a low environmental impact accommodation. It is only 20 minutes by car from Passo Brocon ski area and it offers rooms with mountain view. It offers electronic bike rental and free wi-fi connection. \nAll the rooms and the apartments of B&B Tomaselli have wooden furniture and cable TV, and some of them also have a balcony. The flats are equipped with kitchenette, dining area and washing machine. \nEvery morning we serve breakfast with freshly baked bread, traditional donuts “Krapfen” and homemade apple and blueberries juice. \nThe B&B is 7 minutes by car from Castelnuovo, 20 km from the Thermal Spa in Levico and 15 minutes by car from a swimming pool. ",
                "IT" : "Vi ringraziamo per averci scelto per la vostra vacanza. Potete prendere possesso della vostra camera dalle 10 alle 21. \nLa prima colazione è servita dalle 7 alle 9.30.\nPer qualunque esigenza contattatemi al 335 8086735.\nMassimo Luzzana\n"
