            "description" : {
                "EN" : "For those who require all the commodities of the hotel, with the addition of the privacy and independence of an apartment, we have developed a new Aparthotel.\nThe rooms and apartments are particularly welcoming and complete with all modern comfort. \nAll bedrooms are equipped with telephone, TV, internet, bathroom with shower and hairdryer and safety deposit box, etc \nAll apartments and a few rooms have Satellite TV there is big terrace and garden with view on \nthe lake of Caldonazzo. \nThe Hotel is a Garni, therefore hospitality includes the overnight stay and a rich buffet breakfast.",
