                "EN" : "The Antica Rosa Hotel is one of the oldest structures dedicated to hospitality in Levico Terme. It is recalled as far back as the end of the 1800`s and it is not to be excluded that it is even older. Initial information reports that the Antica Rosa was a \"trattoria\" with a few guest rooms. During the world conflicts it was used by soldiers and officials and then slowly turned into the hotel it is today. The Moschen family have run the Hotel since 1972. The original structure had about twenty rooms and can be recognized still today, by the blue facade. The adjacent building was bought 10 years later, in 1982, and 22 extra rooms were created, making the Hotel even more comfortable.\nMore than a century of history, passionately dedicated to our work. This is our pride and joy that encourages us to continue day after day, looking forward to the future but always keeping in mind the hospitality that has been passed down to our family through the centuries.\nThe hotel guarantees a peaceful stay in very welcoming and comfortable rooms, flavoursome and healthy food, just like at home; a splendid terrace for relaxing in the afternoons or for spending the evenings in delightful company whilst enjoying the impressive lake view and sipping cool drinks from the Hotel bar.",
                "IT" : "Un Cordiale Benvenuto in Valsugana Levico Terme dall'Hotel Antica Rosa.\n\nL'Hotel Antica Rosa garantisce ad ogni cliente una vacanza cara ed esclusiva. La gestione diretta dei proprietari offre un'atmosfera accogliente e tranquilla e la posizione centrale dell'Hotel permette di godere della vita animata e dei servizi di Levico. L'accurata cucina e i confort  uniti alla familiarità e alla cordialità dei proprietari arricchiscono il soggiorno della clientela più esigente."
            },
