            },
            "description" : {
                "EN" : "The Hotel Cristallo is situated in the upper side of Levico, in a very quiet area close to the centre, to the spa, and to the beautiful imperial park, which has been recently restored with ecological systems. The Hotel is provided with many spaces for common use, and it offers a friendly atmosphere thanks to the family management which also directly looks after the cooking.\n\nThe Hotel is a four-storey building offering 85 rooms, each with private bathroom, radio, colour TV, phone, hair-dryer, safe, balcony. \n\nAnd moreover: restaurant, living room, games room, TV room, reading room, conference hall (up to 100 seats), bar, gymnasium, table tennis, two bilyops (small table to play bowls), two lifts, free garage for bikes and motorcycles with alarm.\n\nWe are partners of MoHo-Motorrad Hotels and Bike-holidays. We offer a wide range of services for bikers.\n\n",
                "IT" : "La stanza si intende riservata dalle ore 14.00 del giorno di arrivo fino alle ore 10.00 del giorno di partenza.\nIn caso di cancellazione della prenotazione verrà trattenuta la caparra versata"
