            "entityUri" : null,
            "name" : {
                "IT" : "B&B RENE' - COPAT RENATA"
            },
            "description" : {
                "EN" : "Situated in a quiet village, a hamlet of Levico in Valsugana, well known for it’s\nlittle naturale lakeand ancient spa, with ferruginous arsenic water.\nThe B & B accomodation is in a strategic position for sport activities and for nature lovers.\nIn summertime you will find a lot of cool places to make mountain excursions or to visit the\nnearby Arte Sella (permanent exhibition) of comtemporary art qith works\ncreated and installed in the forest of Sella Valley.\nIn winter you can easily join the ski slopes (Panarotta) and many paths for snowshoes or nordic walking.\nWe are 3 km from Lake Levico where you can swim and relax on the big and free beach.\nHomemade breakfast, with priority to local and regional products.\n\n\n\nOther services:\n\n- Bike path of Valsugana (Lake Caldonazzo- Bassano del Grappa)\n- Near handling and landing hag glides and paragliding\n- Near playground\n\nPrice: B & B -\n€ 30,00 price for person double room\n€ 35,00 price for person double room with private bathroom\nDiscount for children: Free up to 4 years\n2 bedrooms\n1 bathroom\n6 single beds\n1 bedroom with private bathroom\nParking lot\nPets accepted\nBikes and moto parking with possibility of small maintenance\nSpace for children",
                "IT" : "Situato in un paese tranquillo, a 1 km dalla ciclabile, ideale per gli amanti dello sport e della natura,\n\nin estate non mancano luoghi freschi dove si potranno fare delle escursioni in montagna o visitare la vicina Arte Sella. Siamo a 3 km dal Lago di Levico dove si può fare il bagno e riposare nella grandiosa spiaggia libera. \n\nIn inverno si raggiungono facilmente le piste da sci.\n\nColazione casalinga in famiglia e piccolo parco giochi a pochi metri da casa. \n\nDispone di parcheggio, manutenzione bici e moto, giardino.\n\nSono accettati i piccoli animali"
            },
