            },
            "description" : {
                "EN" : "Open all the year The Camping offers its customers every comfort for a complete holiday: a swimming-pool, a tennis court, the bowl, an amusement arcade, a park for the kids, a supermarket, a restaurant, a bar and a grill, a pizzeria, a open-air theatre. Plunged into parks and gardens at 1,150 m above sea level, the resort offers several outing opportunities such as trekking; in fact, the camping isn't far from Cima d'Asta, a famous high altitude tourist resort with a refuge. Moreover, in the surroundings it's possible to carry out mountain-bikes tours, 18 hole golf, horse-riding as well as sport fishing in plenty of the region streams and tarns.\nSituated at the foot of the magnificent mountains, in a valley of the same name, our village is an ideal base camp for excursions and outings.\nYou can shop in the well-stocked market of the village, but if you are not fond of cooking, try typical dishes and tasty pizzas in our restaurant. A nearby, spacious Maso (a small mountain farmhouse) for a large group its at your disposal.\nBungalows and top-ranking facilities for tents and caravans favor rest and relaxation.\nThe village also offers a heated swimming pool, tennis and volleyball courts, amusement arcade, dancing in our theatre-tend.\n ",
                "IT" : "Per le prenotazioni di piazzola vengono applicate le seguenti condizioni di cancellazione:\nDisdetta entro 10 giorni prima dell'arrivo: nessuna penale\nDisdetta successiva a tale termine o no show: pagamento dell'importo della piazzola per il totale del soggiorno (esclusi importi degli occupanti)"
