            },
            "description" : {
                "EN" : "Are you looking for a peaceful corner without missing out on visiting the most attractive places in Trentino? Welcome to the Hotel Bavaria! Situated only 200 m. from the beautiful Lake of Levico, surrounded by the green ofthe mountains, the recently renovated hotel has 42 bedrooms with balcony, private bathroom, telephone, TV and safe. We offer our clients comfort and the most restful atmosphere. \nJust a short walk from the hotel, in this beautiful mountain village you can spend yoyr days in one of the most renowned Spas in Italy or you can stay in the hotel relaxing by the pool where you will be looked after by our attentive staff.",
                "IT" : "Arriva in auto:\n\nIn Automobile:\n*************************\nAutostrada A22 uscita TRENTO CENTRO,\nimboccare la Strada statale 47 :\ndirezione Padova: uscita Levico Terme da Venezia\ndirezione Trento: Strada statale 47, uscita Levico Terme\n\nArrivo in treno:\n\nIN AUTOBUS\nDa Trento (autostazione) circa 40 minuti\n- fermata “Ristorante Brenta”.\n\nIn Treno\n*************************\nDa Trento o da Venezia, la stazione ferroviaria di Levico\nTerme dista 2 km dall’Hotel Bavaria."
