                "EN" : "A hearty welcome at  Hotel Cima d'Asta in Pieve Tesino \nFeel at home in the hearty and attentive atmosphere of our hotel, take pleasure in the familiar and discrete service and enjoy your holidays in perfect freedom.Hotel Cima d'Asta, completely refurbished, is situated in sunny and quiet location, in the village centre. It’s at only 10 Km from the ropeways and is a good starting point for excursions in the mountains and walks.\nThe hotel has 10 completely renovated rooms. Furnished in a modern way and comfortable, are the best place to finish a holiday day for the comfort they offer: TV color, radio, direct phone, private services with shower, wide balcony, hair dryer and safe.\nWe have a special attention for the enjoyable stay of our handicap-bearer guests.\nFamily room with 3-4 beds. Linen and baby cots are available on request.\n\nExpect fine delicacies during your visit in Pieve Tesino. The cuisine in Hotel Cima d'Asta  will indulge you, with Mediterranean delights and South Tyrolean specialities. \nThe menu has lots of treats in store for you. The delicious pizzas come straight oven to your plate, crisp and fresh. The aromas will fill with enthusiasm you. \n\nDevote time to your-self The Bar Cima d' Asta is a perfect place to spend some relaxing time sipping one of the many local specialities. Faced with an exquisite glass of local wine or a hot drink to ward off the winter cold, the Bar Cima d' Asta is a cozy place designed to make you feel at home.At the bar you'll be able to spend some moments of intime relax reading a good book while drinking a hot drink. And for the more exigent palate a good distillate or a mountain herbal tea.\n",
                "IT" : "Benvenuti all'Hotel Cima d'Asta di Pieve Tesino.\nCircondati da una cordiale ed attenta ospitalità e dalla calda atmosfera di un ambiente semplice e familiare vi sentirete come a casa vostra, \"viziati e coccolati\" con discrezione, liberi di dedicarvi in pieno relax e tranquillità alla vostra vacanza.\nL'Hotel recentemente rinnovato è situato in centro, in posizione soleggiata e tranquilla.Dispone di 10 nuovissime stanze modernamente arredate e accoglienti dotate di ogni comfort: TV e radio, telefono diretto, servizi privati, balcone, asciugacapelli e cassaforte.\nParticolare attenzione è stata posta per favorire l’ospitalità alle persone disabili. \nIl ristorante/pizzeria vi regalerà ogni giorno squisite prelibatezze: le ricette della tradizione locale, i piatti della cucina italiana e internazionale ed un'ampia scelta di pizze per soddisfare ogni esigente palato. \nAmpio parcheggio riservato"
            },
