            },
            "description" : {
                "EN" : "Camping Lago di Levico... a fantastic place where to spend unforgettable holidays in the heart of a pure and uncontaminated nature. It is a natural park ideal for those guests who want to relax themselves, enjoy with the own family or experience different types of sports. Our big private beach on Lake Levico is safe expecially for children of all ages. Moreover, there are three new swimmingpools where to do acquagym, to play numerous sport activities and to follow the rich animation program or, why not, lay in the sun on our solarium. Lake Levico is a real jewel to be discovered: it is possibile to swim in its crystal clear water (the most uncontaminated in Europe!) already starting from April.Camping Lago di Levico: the only one faced on Lake Levico with a private beach!\n ",
