                "IT" : "CARRARO"
            },
            "description" : {
                "EN" : "The hotel and restaurant Carraro is situated in the little village Bieno, a gracious locality on the Tesino plateau.\nIt is an ideal starting point for excursions and wonderful walks in the territory of the granite mountain group Rava.\nThe hotel has welcoming and bright rooms, all with bath and TV.\nThe restaurant with its home cooking is successful in exalting tasters and aromas of the area without missing out genuine and simple dishes... moreover there is an every day open bar.\n",
