                "EN" : "The hotel, with ist panoramic and quiet position surrounded by a large garden, guarantees the guest an unforgettable holiday.\nRenovated and equipped with every comfort, it offers spacious and comfortable rooms with balconies.\nThe restaurant is run by the family Denart with a great variety of fresh homemade traditional menus and seafood.\nWe organize excursions and trips to the mountains and the lake.\nThere is also a free shuttle bus service to hotel spa\n",
                "IT" : "L'albergo, nuova gestione famiglia Denart, con la sua posizione panoramica e tranquilla, contornato da un ampio giardino, garantisce al cliente una vacanza indimenticabile.\nRinnovato e dotato di ogni comfort offre ampie e accoglienti stanze con balcone.\nLa cucina è curata direttamente dalla Famiglia Denart con prodotti freschi fatti in casa e grande varietà di menù tipici e di mare.\nVengono organizzate escursioni e gite in montagna e al lago, viene inoltre offerto un servizio di bus navetta gratuito hotel-terme."
            },
            "longDescription" : {},
            "serviceDescription" : {
                "EN" : "children's menu : 1\ndietary cuisine : 1\nsafe : 1\nmulti-bed room/s : 7\nmeeting/seminar rooms for max. pers. : 0\nheating : 1\ncar parking lot : 1\nsingle room/s : 6\ndouble room/s : 17\nbar : 1\nwheelchair access : 1\nTV room : 1\nown garden : 1\nlift/elevator : 1\ncentral location : 1\nrestaurant : 1\nsatellite TV : 1\n",
