                "IT" : "DUE SPADE"
            },
            "description" : {
                "EN" : "In a central position, this cosy facility was a well-established family management.\nIts simple communal spaces are enriched by small details. Given the beautiful landscape and the rich natural treasures, guests are enchanted by this resort.\nThe Dolomites and the cities of art within easy reach and the sports centre, the bathing establishment and the free-climbing practice wall are nearby.\nThe Hotel Due Spade, located in the charming centre of Caldonazzo, has been managed by the Marchesoni family since 1897. Following in the tradition of hospitality throughout the generations, Mrs. Irma and her family are delighted to offer a professional approach to your holiday in a comfortable family atmosphere inside a building that has a strong history.\nThe Hotel Due Spade is renowned for its light and genuine cuisine, with home made dishes that offer local Trentino and Italian good cooking combined with healthy eating. In an elegant veranda looking out over the garden our guests can start the day well with a rich buffet breakfast and then savour their holiday to the full with lunch and dinner in the two dining rooms. ",
